# ClangSharpPInvokeGenerator response file for libpipewire-0.3.
# Invoked by generate/generate.sh - see that script for prerequisites.
#
# The .g.cs files in src/PipeWire.NET/generated/ are the committed library contract;
# downstream consumers do not need PipeWire headers to build against this library.

# Single composite root header at generate/pipewire_composite.h (re-exports the
# upstream headers we want bindings for). A single --file root avoids the
# duplicate-emission ClangSharp produces with multiple roots.
#
# --traverse: ClangSharp emits declarations only from files named here (it matches
# whole paths - directory prefixes match nothing, and there is no "all reachable"
# mode). This list is therefore the explicit set of native surface we expose; add a
# header here to expose more. Keep it in sync when bumping the PipeWire version.

# - PipeWire public surface -
--traverse
/usr/include/pipewire-0.3/pipewire/pipewire.h
